{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國家科學基金會與能源部資助的維拉·魯賓天文台發現了太陽系外緣天體2026 ED138。它位於海王星軌道之外，初步估計直徑約600至1500公裏，可能是迄今發現的較大型矮行星候選天體之一；但它還沒有被正式確認為矮行星，暫時也只有臨時編號。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584194.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:01:12.335088+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:49:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:58:14.058935+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:58:14.058935+00:00","content_hash":"1ce6cfc74e557ed0e953f789076e9d2bf7f1ae77afb10b82d08fbcece0bba456","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}